@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "gym-buddy Android App" {
  [Compose UI] as UI
  [Workout Session Controller] as Session
  [Camera Controller\n(CameraX)] as Camera
  [Frame Scheduler\nlatest-frame / backpressure] as Scheduler
  [Pose Perception\n(MediaPipe, bundled model)] as Pose
  [Ordered Result Gate] as Ordered
  [Serialized Analysis Lane] as AnalysisLane
  [Coordinate Normalizer] as Normalize
  [Signal Processor\nconfidence-aware smoothing / velocity] as Signal
  [Tracking Quality Gate] as Quality
  [Temporal Reset Coordinator] as Reset
  [Exercise Analyzer\nIncline DB Press first] as Analyzer
  [Biomechanics Metrics] as Metrics
  [Deterministic Rule Engine\n+ Episode Tracker] as Rules
  [Cue Policy + Arbitrator] as CuePolicy
  [Rep Finalization Assembler] as RepFinalize
  [Live Overlay] as Overlay
  [Telemetry Sampler + Chunker\nbounded persistence rate] as TelemetryStage
  [Short-lived Telemetry Buffer\nbounded / best-effort] as TelemetryBuffer
  [Priority Persistence Queue\nbounded / reserved capacity] as PriorityQueue
  [Serialized Batch Writer\ncommandSequence ordered] as BatchWriter
  [Workout Repository] as Repo
  [Health Connect Adapter] as Health
  [Health Aggregator] as HealthAgg
  [Retention Worker\nstartup + periodic cleanup] as Retention
  [Startup Recovery] as Recovery
  [Room Database] as Room
}

UI --> Session : start/stop set
Session --> Repo : create/close workout hierarchy
Session --> Camera : start / stop accepting frames
Session --> [Analysis Pipeline] : await full pipeline quiescence on Stop Set
Session --> Reset : exercise/setup reconfiguration
Session --> RepFinalize : finalize partial/in-progress rep on Stop Set
Session --> Rules : finalize active set-scoped episodes
Session --> PriorityQueue : SetCloseBarrier(highWatermark) after finalization

Camera --> Scheduler : frames + monotonic timestamps
Scheduler --> Pose : newest eligible frame
Pose --> Ordered : inference result + source timestamp
Ordered --> AnalysisLane : only strictly increasing timestamps
AnalysisLane --> TelemetryStage : ordered PoseObservation\n(no image bytes)
AnalysisLane --> Normalize : ordered pose output
TelemetryStage --> TelemetryBuffer : versioned PoseObservationChunk
Normalize --> Signal : canonical coordinates
Signal --> Quality : smoothed MovementFrame
Quality --> Analyzer : valid frames only
Quality --> Overlay : tracking/calibration guidance
Quality --> TelemetryBuffer : TrackingEvent on meaningful state changes
Quality --> Reset : significant tracking discontinuity
Reset --> Signal : reset filter / velocity history
Reset --> Analyzer : reset rep temporal state
Reset --> Metrics : reset ROM / tempo / trajectory accumulators
Reset --> Rules : interrupt/reset active temporal rule state
Reset --> RepFinalize : invalidate in-progress trace state

Analyzer --> Metrics : phase + movement features
Metrics --> Rules : metrics + phase + recent history
Rules --> CuePolicy : active actionable issue state
CuePolicy --> Overlay : highest-priority actionable cue
CuePolicy --> [Android TextToSpeech] : offline voice only; otherwise visual fallback

Analyzer --> RepFinalize : rep/partial-rep state on finalization
Metrics --> RepFinalize : final rep metrics
Rules --> RepFinalize : rep-scoped FormEvent finalizations
RepFinalize --> PriorityQueue : atomic RepFinalizationBundle
Rules --> PriorityQueue : revisioned set-scoped FormEvent activation/update/finalization
CuePolicy --> PriorityQueue : CueDelivery when actually delivered

TelemetryBuffer --> BatchWriter : best-effort short-lived batches
PriorityQueue --> BatchWriter : ordered priority commands first
BatchWriter --> Repo : serialized persist / upsert transaction
Repo --> Room
BatchWriter --> Session : SetCloseBarrier commit ack after <= highWatermark durable
Session --> UI : set saved only after ack

Health --> HealthAgg : permitted Health Connect records
HealthAgg --> Repo : compact daily / weekly summaries only
Retention --> Repo : delete expired set telemetry/tracking data
Retention --> [App-private no-backup files] : delete expired debug media
Recovery --> Repo : stale ACTIVE -> INTERRUPTED on startup
UI --> Repo : history / workout state

note bottom of Pose
ML ends here. Everything downstream is deterministic code.
Pose model is bundled; no runtime network download.
end note

note bottom of Ordered
MediaPipe/inference callbacks may complete asynchronously.
Discard late/out-of-order results where timestamp <= lastProcessedTimestamp.
Only one ordered stream enters stateful analysis.
end note

note bottom of AnalysisLane
Normalizer, SignalProcessor, QualityGate, Analyzer, Metrics and Rules
run as one serialized temporal lane for a set.
No concurrent mutation of exercise state is allowed.
end note

note bottom of Signal
Low-confidence/missing landmarks do not update filter state as if valid.
Filtering is confidence-aware before whole-frame quality decisions.
end note

note bottom of RepFinalize
Rep, RepMetric[], CompactRepTrace and rep-scoped finalizations are emitted
as one RepFinalizationBundle and persisted atomically in one Room transaction.
end note

note bottom of PriorityQueue
Commands carry monotonic commandSequence values.
FormEvent upserts carry eventRevision; older revisions cannot overwrite newer ones.
SetCloseBarrier is reserved/non-droppable and carries a highWatermark.
end note

note bottom of Session
Normal Stop Set ordering:
1) stop accepting new camera frames,
2) await inference + ordered gate + analysis lane quiescence,
3) finalize temporal state,
4) enqueue SetCloseBarrier(highWatermark),
5) show saved only after Room commit ack.
Short-lived telemetry never gates close.
end note

@enduml
